{"id": "69030", "title": "下一站再爱你", "author": "关信辉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 5, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/69/69030.htm", "intro": "萱萱的病情日渐加重，眼看自己已经不久人世，她开始担心日后无人照顾万豪，因此，她想把身边的好友介绍给万豪，希望在她离开人世之后有人能代替她照顾万豪......", "base": "files/article/html/69/69030", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10555252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10555253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10555254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10555255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10558375.html", "available": false}]}